"cli.help" = "Usage: shouldrest <command> [options]\n\nCommands:\n  help                         Show this help.\n  version                      Show version.\n  settings                     Show settings location.\n  logs                         Show log location.\n  pause [-d duration]          Pause rests. Duration: indefinitely, until-morning, 60, 1h, 1h20m.\n  resume                       Resume rests.\n  toggle                       Pause or resume rests.\n  reset                        Reset schedule and rest debt.\n  eye|mini [-w wait]           Start Eye Gate now or after wait; it is always strict and text-free.\n  body|long [-T title] [-t text] [-w wait] [-n]  Start or customize Body Break.\n  emergency                    Bring the active Eye Gate overlay forward for Emergency Exit.\n  preferences                  Open ShouldRest preferences.\n  support                      Copy support report.\n  support-panel                Open the support report window.\n  about                        Open the About window.\n  url shouldrest://<command>    Run a shouldrest:// command.";
