"about.title" = "About ShouldRest";
"about.body" = "ShouldRest %@\n\nShouldRest is built around a simple rule: short eye rests need strong protection, while longer movement breaks need humane flexibility.\n\nIt keeps schedules, updates, support tools, and preferences available without turning them into easy skip paths for 20-second Eye Gates.";
